"1544571100702454", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/507819001_1544571104035787_3158544122444530973_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lWIbvIVsDZMQ7kNvwE7fzSc&_nc_oc=AdqzCknv3xh52JUDPztVxD6pYfzDDwZwrCURgZLRIDJ5lrJkw5jj7T-xGYQQXfZGTNY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJwQ4czGgYCoBqr0aoRHsmNNSkHoh77kHaAKAnNl8ONxg&oe=6ABA9177"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "trailer_cover_2560x1440.png", "id": "2056833998595482", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499295279_2056834001928815_3978146616395585472_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lpscveJsEMsQ7kNvwFf-sTb&_nc_oc=Adqq9d2NI_OW0YlJ9X4JDOInJNxh3wC2B72MKF-h15L0ugKhOQlNCUIQq0LV75k4lZY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLprW7Hun_7HlKFtwCvI2BLXxNQ4l3CZJgYhXwxf4do1g&oe=6ABA79EF"}, "display_name": "VR Viewer for Insta360", "keywords": [], "long_description": "VR Viewer for Insta360 turns your Meta Quest into a personal 360\u00b0 cinema for footage from your Insta360 camera (X5, X4, X3, ONE X / X2, ONE R / RS 360).\n\nThree ways to watch:\n\u2022 Camera over USB \u2014 plug your camera into the Quest and play your shots, transcoded at the best resolution for your headset.\n\u2022 Insta360 Cloud \u2014 open a public Insta360 share link and stream a whole album in VR; browse a thumbnail gallery and pick any clip.\n\u2022 Offline cache \u2014 everything you've opened is saved for instant, offline replay.\n\nFeatures:\n- True immersive 360\u00b0 playback with smooth head-tracking.\n- Multi-file cloud albums with a built-in gallery and a history of opened links.\n- Automatic per-headset resolution \u2014 each device gets exactly the sharpness its display can show.\n- 9 languages, auto-selected from your system language.\n- Comfortable VR interface controlled with the Touch controllers.\n\nNote: this is a 360\u00b0 viewer. Single-lens cameras (GO, Ace, Link) record flat video and are not supported. Not affiliated with or endorsed by Insta360 / Arashi Vision.\n", "short_description": "Watch your Insta360 360\u00b0 videos in VR \u2014 from camera, cloud, or offline."}]}, "developer_name": "Alexey Plekhanov", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://iq4u.kz/insta360_vr_viewer/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://iq4u.kz/insta360_vr_viewer/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Alexey Plekhanov", "support_website_url": "https://iq4u.kz/insta360_vr_viewer/#support", "website_url": "https://iq4u.kz/insta360_vr_viewer/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "726368587961803"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "it", "de", "es", "en_US", "en_AU", "en_CA", "en_ZA", "en_GB", "de_CH", "ru", "ru_UA", "es_VE", "es_PR", "es_PE", "es_MX", "es_AR", "es_CL", "es_CO", "zh_TW", "zh_HK", "zh_CN", "ar"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH", "HAND_TRACKING"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1248078940551663"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 4, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1527376475359682"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1659785025124853"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1754055482251055"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1555107999607766"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1555107999607766"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1790096400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1527376475359682"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1303251841701039", "version": "1.0.177"}, "id": "2084606089076778", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "1248078937218330", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "1303251841701039"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": [{"channel_name": "LIVE", "id": "2084606089076778"}]}, "change_log": "What's new since the previous version:\n\n- Export files to your phone or computer: tick files in the gallery, press Export, and download them in your browser over Wi-Fi\n- Share links and QR codes from the Insta360 app now open 360 photos, not just videos\n- Zoom: hold the controller grip button or make a fist \u2014 the image zooms in where you're looking\n- AI detail enhancement while zooming on Quest 3: the image is sharpened for extra clarity\n- New 8K quality mode for maximum video detail\n- Galleries: jump to the first or last page, flip pages with the thumbstick, files sorted by capture date\n- \"Cached\" badge on files that are already downloaded and open instantly\n- The app now speaks 16 languages: added Japanese, Korean, Polish, Dutch, Turkish, Hebrew, and Ukrainian\n- Your background choice (stars or passthrough) no longer resets when switching screens\n- Stability fixes: taking the headset off and on, keyboard input, playback\n", "created_date": 1786649613, "id": "1303251841701039", "version": "1.0.177", "version_code": 177, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 1}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "12480789372183